[L1] The alternating sequence: $|s_k| = 1$, $s_{k+1} = -s_k$, $s_{e_j} = 1$, $s_{o_j} = -1$, with $e$, $o$ strictly increasing, so $e_j \ge j$ and $o_j \ge j$; also $o_0 = \sigma(0) \ge 1$ ([[lem-alternating-sequence]], [[lem-index-map-grows]]).
